OL,3,GNEWSACouncil votes to dispose of closed
OL,4,Acivic centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe community would be involved in the
OL,7,Ffuture of a town's civic centre,
OL,8,FShropshire Council has said, despite
OL,9,Fcouncillors voting on Wednesday to
OL,10,Fdispose of the site.
OL,12,FThe Whitchurch centre shut in September
OL,13,F2023 because reinforced autoclaved
OL,14,Faerated concrete, or Raac, was found,
OL,15,Fand the authority stated it could not
OL,16,Fafford the #4m needed to repair it.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
