OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSACouncil votes to dispose of closed
OL,4,Acivic centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FA community group aiming to save the
OL,7,Fcentre has said putting it "on the
OL,8,Fmarket should be treated as an
OL,9,Fopportunity to test all viable options
OL,10,F- not as the end of the civic centre's
OL,11,Fcommunity future".
OL,13,FLiberal Democrat leaders said they
OL,14,Fwould engage with the community and the
OL,15,Fcouncil was "not selling Whitchurch at
OL,16,Fthe present time".
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
